y to somebody that comes  up to you and says hey man  i was going to kill myself but your  music saved my life  and they take their shirt off and their  whole back is a tattoo of your face  you know what i'm saying how do you say  thank you to that you know hey  thanks guy that don't cover it believe  it or not they look us in the face  and say you saved my life your music  saved my life you know  that type of appreciation from them for  us  for us doing something we love doing and  we would  can do anything to be able to do this  and then to be appreciated like that for  it  it's almost unfathomable you couldn't  ask for a better fan base or better  people in the world you know saying  people from the outside like to look in  make fun of them call them white trash  grown pieces uneducated all that  couldn't be further from the truth you  know saying it's the most warmest  openness  there's from doctors to homeless people  you know what i'm saying the whole  spectrum  just like life juggalos cover the whole  a to z what should i be ready for  tonight  we always tell somebody never seen us  before we're like hey man i'm sorry to  tell you this  we're gonna apologize right now because  you're going to see somebody else we're  [ __ ]  up for you  like us ever again michael buble is  ruined for me now everybody michael  whatever his name is thank you guys so  much i'm looking forward to it  thank you my man thank you we have a  group hug  uh yeah hell yeah i mean yeah  i wish he wasn't here so i could get  your full arms  you doing brother doing well how are you  guys good man i'm doing a lot better now  what was that like uh no words it's 22  years in the making  you look like a doctor or something no  close i work with the handicapped  community actually see  i'm just rambling no words it's awesome  i'm just happy  i'm happy yeah no words i'm so geeked  right now  thank you guys for a second yeah it was  probably 40 more embarrassing than i  thought it was gonna be  o